    "host_prepared": "Account-configured static bearer on a loopback registry. Wrong bearer refused, approved cold blob fetched once, rotated bearer verified on the warm path.",
    "host_oci_metadata": "Separate loopback mirror supplies only verified source manifest and configuration before create and managed command admission.",
    "guest_oci": "Private-address registry bound to a loopback interface, metadata-only SDK egress floor for the test processes, and an exact /32 guest allowlist. Registry traffic uses only generated fixture credentials.",
