    "pull": "Separately approved cold images exercise Docker inline Basic fallback and a Docker credential helper returning an identity token. The guest exchanges the identity token for a fixture-scoped bearer. Both results retain the exact source reference and configuration digest.",
    "inventory": "Observed configuration digest and platform remain exact. The pinned agent can render a registry port as a path component in the display reference."
